    npx:hasSignature "M3FQPI5xIG7RuXUVTCIDyM65OLLb9iGdoC/v+GWKkLgrSc/5Lve7ZojAk0JZL21CG+iBX8AGwevO/vQRuh+d4EPNpejtGzTTgknZU/DZAFNnRr6CaMXNW6nH4XSFeoyunoOWyKSj9u5NUeU1CRiniEhAaAnpEtkfyFYc+Ll2o5g=";
